{"header":{"numFound":6401,"maxScore":9.703484,"queryTime":159,"page":1,"pageSize":10},"results":[{"authors":[{"id":null,"fullName":"Xinnan Li","name":"Xinnan","surname":"Li","rank":1,"pid":null},{"id":null,"fullName":"Kai Ma","name":"Kai","surname":"Ma","rank":2,"pid":null},{"id":null,"fullName":"Junjian Yang","name":"Junjian","surname":"Yang","rank":3,"pid":null},{"id":null,"fullName":"Zhonghui He","name":"Zhonghui","surname":"He","rank":4,"pid":null},{"id":null,"fullName":"Junwei Qian","name":"Junwei","surname":"Qian","rank":5,"pid":null}],"openAccessColor":"hybrid","publiclyFunded":false,"eoscIfGuidelines":null,"type":"publication","language":{"code":"und","label":"Undetermined"},"countries":null,"subjects":[{"subject":{"scheme":"FOS","value":"05 social sciences"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"FOS","value":"0501 psychology and cognitive sciences"},"provenance":null}],"mainTitle":"Long-term aerobic exercise and exercise memory effect: The role of exercise intensity","subTitle":null,"descriptions":["<jats:title>Abstract</jats:title>         <jats:p>Long-term aerobic exercise can improve the level of declarative memory and procedural memory, especially under different intensity exercise, the improvement effect of declarative memory is more obvious.This study adopted a mixed design, selected 569 college students as the research objects, through 8 weeks of different intensity of exercise intervention, to explore the effect of post-exercise memory effect. The changes of declarative memory and procedural memory before and after exercise in the low-intensity exercise group, the moderate-intensity exercise group and the control group were respectively measured. The results showed that the medium-intensity aerobic exercise had a selective positive influence on the memory effect of college students after exercise, and it did not change with the change of gender.</jats:p>"],"publicationDate":"2023-01-11","publisher":"Research Square Platform LLC","embargoEndDate":null,"sources":["Crossref"],"formats":null,"contributors":null,"coverages":null,"bestAccessRight":{"code":"c_abf2","label":"OPEN","scheme":"http://vocabularies.coar-repositories.org/documentation/access_rights/"},"container":null,"documentationUrls":null,"codeRepositoryUrl":null,"programmingLanguage":null,"contactPeople":null,"contactGroups":null,"tools":null,"size":null,"version":null,"geoLocations":null,"id":"doi_________::d82a4553c524f6c170a69925d87d3806","originalIds":["10.21203/rs.3.rs-2427219/v1","50|doiboost____|d82a4553c524f6c170a69925d87d3806"],"pids":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-2427219/v1"}],"dateOfCollection":null,"lastUpdateTimeStamp":null,"indicators":{"citationImpact":{"citationCount":0.0,"influence":2.1746283E-9,"popularity":1.6835128E-9,"impulse":0.0,"citationClass":"C5","influenceClass":"C5","impulseClass":"C5","popularityClass":"C5"}},"projects":null,"organizations":[{"legalName":"Hebei University","acronym":"Hebei University","id":"openorgs____::0153f073c67e09c2b54ae61176deed59","pids":[{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"21153639"},{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.459531.f"},{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"15823474"},{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"43337087"},{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"173899330"},{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.410747.1"},{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.440663.3"},{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.256922.8"},{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"46482218"},{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"49232843"},{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.411412.3"},{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.256885.4"},{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"13175533"}],"countries":[{"code":"CN","label":"China (People's Republic of)"}],"websiteurl":"http://www.hbu.edu.cn/"},{"legalName":"China University of Geosciences","acronym":"CUG","id":"openorgs____::13663d6edd9254920317bdbaccb79f19","pids":[{"scheme":"wikidata","value":"Q48880972"},{"scheme":"PIC","value":"996066035"},{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.162107.3"},{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.503241.1"},{"scheme":"ISNI","value":"000000012156409X